+| `api` pod events | `getPodEvents(default, api-75854b6bd-vljcp)` | Included above |
+| `api` deployment description & rollout | `describeDeployment(default, api)` | Included above |
+| `web` pod description | `describePod(default, web-564f7688c4-bqzxj)` | Included above |
+| `web` pod logs | `getPodLogs(default, web-564f7688c4-bqzxj)` | Included above |
+| `web` pod events | `getPodEvents(default, web-564f7688c4-bqzxj)` | Included above |
+| `web` deployment description & rollout | `describeDeployment(default, web)` | Included above |
+| `worker` pod description | `describePod(default, worker-5d745c6779-z55mp)` | Included above |
+| `worker` pod logs | `getPodLogs(default, worker-5d745c6779-z55mp)` | Included above |
+| `worker` pod events | `getPodEvents(default, worker-5d745c6779-z55mp)` | Included above |
+| `worker` deployment description & rollout | `describeDeployment(default, worker)` | Included above |
+
+These artifacts should provide the root‑cause analysis agent with everything needed to determine why the `api`, `web`, and `worker` workloads are unhealthy and to recommend remediation steps.
